<title>USA: MGE deliverable HRS wheat stocks.</title>
<headline>MGE deliverable HRS wheat stocks.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS, MN 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Minneapolis Grain Exchange reported stocks of hard red spring wheat in deliverable position as of Nov 1, in 000 bushels. Stocks in exchange approved elevators deliverable against MGE futures. Deliverable and non-deliverable grades exclude CCC stocks.</p>
<p>						Nov 1    WEEK    YEAR</p>
<p>							   AGO     AGO </p>
<p>						   MINNEAPOLIS AREA  </p>
<p>Deliverable				 2,287   2,472   1,849</p>
<p>Non-deliverable				 7	 7     713</p>
<p>CCC stocks				     21	21	34</p>
<p>Total					 2,315   2,500   2,596</p>
<p>						   DULUTH/SUPERIOR   </p>
<p>Deliverable				 9,202   9,074  10,699</p>
<p>Non-deliverable			     632     907   2,734</p>
<p>CCC stocks				     47     633     995</p>
<p>Total					 9,881  10,614  14,428</p>
<p> Note: Minneapolis area includes Minneapolis/St Paul/Red Wing.  (Chicago newsdesk 312 983 7278)  REUTER</p>
